# reduced-reset (plan section 6, M10): motion-reset under reduced motion (prefers-reduced-motion:
# reduce; macOS's Reduce motion natively): no first paint, and no jump: Reset all puts the curve at
# its default at once; each changed term's flash comes in over 80 ms linearly and fades over the
# last 120 ms of its 600 (fvMotion.ts flashAt). The same frames as motion-reset.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 383 424
wait 16
type "2"
key Enter
click 383 468
wait 16
type "1"
key Enter
click 383 529
wait 16
type "1.5"
key Enter
click 383 573
wait 16
type "-1"
key Enter
click 760 48
wait 1000
shot set
click 400 376
frames reset every 80 for 480
wait 520
shot reset-rest
